  "description": "Eric, an orphan boy offered to the Demon King as a sacrifice under the guise of a \"bride.\"\n\nThough he had braced himself to be devoured, the Demon King was dazzlingly beautiful and gentle.   \nFrom that day on, Eric had only one goal: to become the \"best bride.\"\n\nYears later, a much-grown Eric is still striving to become the \"perfect bride.\"   \nThen one day, he hears something shocking from his friend John.\n\n\"Is kissing...   \nalways that rough?   \nI thought my tongue was going to get ripped out.\"\n\n...A kiss?   \nEven I, his bride, haven't had one yet?!\n\nUnable to take it anymore, Eric storms off to confront the Demon King...\n\n\"Hyung, why don't we ever kiss?\"\n\nWill Eric truly be able to claim the Demon King's lips?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Diablo_newlyweds)",
